 "nl": [
  "Hosts in library may reach backup over SSH (TCP 22) and MySQL (TCP 3306).",
  "No packet from dmz-web may enter library, even for services open to everyone.",
  "Hosts in vpn-users may reach partners over SNMP (UDP 161) and syslog (UDP 514).",
  "dmz-web is isolated: it may only reach printers on HTTPS (TCP 443); partners on syslog (UDP 514), and nothing else.",
  "Allow hr to connect to ops using HTTPS (TCP 443).",
  "engineering may use TCP ports 1024-65535 towards partners, except PostgreSQL (TCP 5432), which must be blocked.",
  "Any zone may connect to library over NTP (UDP 123) and HTTP (TCP 80)."
